WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:07.975
Every record in The 504 Database is classified by AI — the Neural Processing Unit at the core of TENET5.

00:00:07.925 --> 00:00:14.437
This page documents how AI processes, classifies, and routes accountability records.

00:00:14.437 --> 00:00:22.325
All classifications are baked at build time, not generated dynamically, ensuring reproducibility and auditability.
